  "description": "Server-authoritative buffs/debuffs for SetNet: apply/remove timed, stacking status effects on any target key (player or entity); a timer expires them and pushes changes to the affected player and to watchers (e.g. players fighting a boss). Configurable stack/refresh policies via StatusEffectDefinition. server.UseStatusEffects() + client.UseStatusEffects().WatchAsync(target). Depends only on SetNet.",
